(7691568, 1260487, 3306, '<td valign="top">This was definitely the standout entry in this challenge. It is so realistic and believable as a film noir. We all agree that those low votes are irritating and malicious.  If someone feels that strongly they should have the courage to stick up for their opinion and write a critique to explain their reasoning. They owe the artist at least that.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-04-12 06:27:23.</i></td>', 'This was definitely the standout entry in this challenge. It is so realistic and believable as a film noir. We all agree that those low votes are irritating and malicious.  If someone feels that strongly they should have the courage to stick up for their opinion and write a critique to explain their reasoning. They owe the artist at least that.', '2021-04-12 07:26:46.000000', '2021-04-12 07:27:23.000000', 0),
