(7691582, 1260487, 143116, '<td valign="top">Great shot - congratulations. Best of the bunch. Just a thought: could it perhaps be that the "1" was actually entered accidentally, by a user who used the keyboard and intended to given you a 10? It''s certainly a nicer thought than thinking this was done intentionally ...</td>', 'Great shot - congratulations. Best of the bunch. Just a thought: could it perhaps be that the "1" was actually entered accidentally, by a user who used the keyboard and intended to given you a 10? It''s certainly a nicer thought than thinking this was done intentionally ...', '2021-04-12 10:47:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691584, 1260487, 86447, '<td valign="top">There''s no way this didn''t have the Lev Stamp all over it!   That lighting!     See?  I told you it was the LevT Challenge!  :D<br/> <br/>I love this.  Perfect lighting... perfect props... and models!<br/> <br/>If it makes you feel any better, if that "One Vote" person hadn''t voted, this would only have placed second in your lineup... not first.<br/> <br/>32 votes times 7.5938 = 243<br/>minus one... is 242 divided by 31 votes = 7.8065<br/> <br/>Your highest is a whopping  7.8557  !!<br/> <br/>Congratulations anyway...</td>', 'There''s no way this didn''t have the Lev Stamp all over it!   That lighting!     See?  I told you it was the LevT Challenge!  :D I love this.  Perfect lighting... perfect props... and models! If it makes you feel any better, if that "One Vote" person hadn''t voted, this would only have placed second in your lineup... not first. 32 votes times 7.5938 = 243minus one... is 242 divided by 31 votes = 7.8065 Your highest is a whopping  7.8557  !! Congratulations anyway...', '2021-04-12 11:56:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691590, 1260495, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon, Gaby. Excellent portrait.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-04-12 11:38:46.</i></td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon, Gaby. Excellent portrait.', '2021-04-12 12:33:42.000000', '2021-04-12 12:38:46.000000', 0),
