(7691601, 1260487, 124815, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Oddly enough, I forgot to vote on this challenge - it happens sometimes, but I would have marked 9 (hmm, again the tree on the left). The 1 mark is quite interesting so to speak ; one would think that the interest and appreciation of good photography surpasses the desire to win by all means.<br/> <br/>On second look, the color variant is spectacular - the light on the man hands and face deserves applause.</td>', 'Excellent. Oddly enough, I forgot to vote on this challenge - it happens sometimes, but I would have marked 9 (hmm, again the tree on the left). The 1 mark is quite interesting so to speak ; one would think that the interest and appreciation of good photography surpasses the desire to win by all means. On second look, the color variant is spectacular - the light on the man hands and face deserves applause.', '2021-04-12 13:29:49.000000', NULL, 0),
